{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MExpense 是一款為工程師與思考型使用者而設的高精度財務帳簿，能記錄每筆交易、自動化信封預算，並以開發者級清晰度監察帳戶；現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-93.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>高精度財務記錄與帳戶監察</h2>\n<p>MExpense 以高精度財務帳簿方式整理收支，讓每筆交易都有清晰記錄；使用者可自動化信封預算，並以開發者級清晰度監察各帳戶狀況，減少猜測金錢去向。適合需要嚴謹追蹤個人支出的工程師與思考型使用者。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-332-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-333-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-334-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-335-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-336-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-337-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MExpense – Personal Expenses</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mexpense-personal-expenses/id6813857429?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:40:39.817866+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T16:19:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:18:13.095744+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:38:27.079685+00:00","content_hash":"bdaf6fac86b7a48fe1973a0acab843f46e41f2786ebd26aae30022582fd4896c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:40:39.817866+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}